+rear hinges and narrow bright running seams are visible. The open leaf reveals
+the actual cabin/seat. The188mm lower-stem route is not dominant at this camera,
+but is not established as invisible. This resolves review of these six chosen
+source views only. It is not full near/mid published/phone/photo appearance
+approval, passage/fit proof or adoption, and no recipe flag changes follow.
