+The proposed interval helper ports the sealed GPL-3.0-or-later outside-app
+`interval_batch.py` SHA256
+`1aa9d3de5b51ab7404a7aa74312d43f0d30f24a5a1ff40b3616359f7c469b45c`
+from sealed checkpoint
+`6e0534cc` (full hash in the source packet). Its only semantic import adaptation
+is `sat_batch`→`sampled_sat`, which is already the exact same reviewed SAT source.
