+Atomic progress remains bounded in frequency and records current chunk/counters
+before expensive work when due. An interruption/timeout cannot become PASS.
+
+New native caller controls are prepared for ordered259-pair/128-row boundaries,
+independent original outcomes and per-pair DFS hashes, omitted/false-clear/order
+corruptions, unsupported-setting scalar fallback, both numerical thresholds and
+full-check orchestration (all15 samples and unresolved/contact rejection).
+These controls and a complete actual-model interval proof are **UNRUN for this
